# Boost on 19's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# The lead gets four battle moves auto_battle chooses between by type (HP full, every PP full): Earthquake,
# Crunch, Seed Bomb and Rock Slide cover TRAINER_RIVAL_ROUTE_209_TURTWIG (STARAVIA 25, BUIZEL 23, ROSELIA 23,
# MONFERNO 27) and the Route 209/210/215 trainers, among them Route 215's unavoidable Ace Trainers Maya (ROSELIA 24,
# RALTS 24, LICKITUNG 25) and Dennis (GLIGAR 24, BUIZEL 24, DRIFBLIM 25: Earthquake cannot touch Gligar or Drifblim,
# Rock Slide and Crunch can). Cut and Rock Smash go to a second Pokemon behind the egg-hatched Togepi (slots 0-1; its
# own level-40 moves stay in 2-3, a backup fighter), so no field move takes a battle slot.
party-level 0 55
party-move 0 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
party-move 0 1 MOVE_CRUNCH
party-move 0 2 MOVE_SEED_BOMB
party-move 0 3 MOVE_ROCK_SLIDE
party SPECIES_BIBAREL 40 ITEM_NONE
party-move 2 0 MOVE_CUT
party-move 2 1 MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
